## Process discipline (permanent)

- One implementor per numbered plan step.
- Prose never goes through the pipeline — agent instructions, methodology docs, README and wording-only text changes are edited directly by the main agent; only behavior-changing code is pipelined (user, 2026-10-09).
- Pause for user approval before the build.
- Every /aide session checks the board at boot and keeps the feature's cards and `## Kanban` links current.
- Card progress goes into the card's stash; session.aide stays an index.
- Cleanup of plan/todo/brief goes through aide_cleanup via aide-maintainer.
